    "Click here to re-send the verification email.": "Нажмите здесь, чтобы отправить письмо подтверждения повторно.",
    "This is a secure area of the application. Please confirm your password before continuing.": "Это защищенный раздел приложения. Подтвердите пароль для продолжения.",
    "Regular users see only their own requests. Employees and Admins see all requests. Without this, the Requests page returns a 403.": "Обычные пользователи видят только свои заявки. Сотрудники и администраторы видят все заявки.",
    "Users with this permission can open the \"New Request\" form and submit requests into the system. Without it, the button is hidden.": "Пользователи с этим правом могут создавать новые заявки.",
    "Allows opening the Edit form and saving changes. Typically granted to Admin and senior employees, not to regular clients.": "Разрешает редактирование заявок.",
    "Allows clicking the \"Advance\" and \"Return\" buttons on a request. Each transition is logged in the stage history. Grant to employees and admins who process requests.": "Разрешает перевод заявки вперед и назад по этапам.",
    "Bypasses the sequential stage rules entirely and moves the request directly to any chosen stage. Use only for corrections or emergencies. Grant exclusively to Administrators.": "Позволяет переносить заявку на любой этап в обход правил.",
    "Shows the \"Assign To\" control on the request detail page. The assigned employee receives a notification and appears in the request header. Typically granted to managers and admins.": "Отображает возможность назначения ответственного сотрудника.",
    "Without this, users only see public comments (visible to all). With it, all visibility levels — including \"Employee Only\" and \"Admin Only\" — are shown. Grant to staff members.": "Позволяет видеть внутренние комментарии сотрудников и администраторов.",
    "Follow-ups are scheduled tasks attached to a request (e.g. \"Call client on Thursday\"). Employees use these to track action items. Without this, the Follow-ups section is hidden.": "Позволяет вести задачи и напоминания по заявке.",
    "Each request can have a list of arranged services (e.g. flights, hotels). This permission controls the \"Add Service\" form on the request detail page. Clients never see this.": "Управляет прикреплением услуг к заявке.",
    "Controls access to Admin → Service Catalog. Services defined here are the options employees pick from when adding services to a request. Grant to admins responsible for the catalog.": "Управляет доступом к каталогу услуг компании.",
    "Employees with this permission see the \"Upload\" button on the request detail page. They can attach PDFs, images, and documents to any stage and control who can see each file (Admin Only / Internal / Shared with Client). Also grants full read access to all attachments.": "Позволяет загружать файлы на этапах и настраивать их видимость.",
    "Read-only access to stage attachments. Employees can download files but cannot upload or delete. Admin-only files remain hidden. Grant to employees who need to view documents without the ability to modify them.": "Доступ только для чтения и скачивания вложений.",
    "Shows the \"Trash\" link in the navigation. Users without this see a 403 if they try to visit the URL directly.": "Отображает раздел корзины в меню.",
    "Moves a trashed request back to normal status, making it visible and editable again. No data is lost — this is a safe operation.": "Восстанавливает удаленную заявку из корзины.",
    "This is irreversible. The database row, all attachments, comments, follow-ups, and stage history for that request will be deleted forever. Grant only to super-admins.": "Безвозвратно удаляет заявку и все связанные файлы.",
    "Unlocks the entire Admin section including Users, Roles & Permissions, Service Types, and Audit Log. A user with this permission can grant themselves any other permission. Grant only to trusted administrators.": "Предоставляет полный доступ к панели администратора.",
    "The audit log shows every action taken: who created, edited, transitioned, or deleted requests and when. Useful for accountability and debugging. Read-only — it cannot be edited.": "Предоставляет доступ к журналу аудита всех действий в системе.",
    "The request is not permanently removed — it is hidden from normal views but can be restored. No data is lost.": "Заявка скрывается из списков, но может быть восстановлена.",
